4. THE RULES AND THE EXPORT HANDLING ARE THE VALUABLE PART
===============================================================================

For the avoidance of doubt, the order checking logic — including without
limitation the contents of `src/rules/`, `src/parse/` and `src/config.ts`, the
rule set and the precedence between its categories, the thresholds, fee wording
and note wording held in the configuration, and the handling of the Pronto
export layout and its quirks — embodies Jaybel's business processes, trading
terms and document formats, and is confidential commercial information of
Jaybel. Clause 3 applies to it in full, and clause 3.2 in particular applies to
porting that logic to another language or framework.


