6. CUSTOMER DATA
===============================================================================

The Software runs entirely in the browser. The exports a user loads are read on
that user's own machine, and are not uploaded, transmitted or stored by the
Software or by Jaybel's hosting of it.

This repository is public, so no real Pronto export, customer list or other
personal information may be committed to it. Any sample data kept in the
repository for testing must be invented. Nothing in this clause limits Jaybel's
obligations under the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) in respect of personal information
handled outside the Software.


