continue to work if the export template or the rules of the business change. AN
ORDER MUST STILL BE CHECKED BY A PERSON BEFORE ITS STATUS IS CHANGED, IT IS
RELEASED FOR PICKING, OR IT IS RELIED ON FOR ANY INVOICING, ACCOUNTING OR TAX
PURPOSE.


